# A Today entry duplicated and moved to the end of the list goes away on undo and comes back at the end on redo.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs @due({today})
	- Plan sprint @due({today})
END
keys gt D <A-j> <A-j>
see ▌ - Write report  Work
keys z
keys Z
keys gg G x
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Write report @due({today}) @done({today})
	- Review PRs @due({today})
	- Plan sprint @due({today})
END
